# RLAB Analysis Tool - Time-Series Forecasting and Statistical Simulation

This module implements advanced time-series forecasting and statistical simulation capabilities using Rlab.

## Core Functions
- forecast_time_series: Forecasts future values based on historical data
- simulate_statistics: Performs statistical simulations
- analyze_trend: Analyzes trends in time-series data
- compute_confidence_intervals: Computes confidence intervals for predictions

## Usage
Load the module and call the desired functions:
```
source("main.rlab")
result <- forecast_time_series(data, model)
```

